  "description": "Dependency-free forward-error-correction and checksum primitives for .NET: a systematic Reed-Solomon codec over GF(2^8) with configurable parity and first-consecutive-root (Berlekamp-Massey / Chien search / Forney decode), CRC-16/X.25, the FreeDV CRC-16, Hamming(7,4), and a golden-prime block interleaver. Extracted from the pdn-soundmodem packet-radio modem; used by amateur-radio FEC/framing but general-purpose.",
